                                "sense_id": "6152959f-ce14-32fd-86a8-671d81b7d983",
                                "text": "A mandrel may be utilized to cast or dip-coat the polymeric substrate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3ef3d70-26e0-4d26-904b-1f55a762a862",
                                "sense_id": "6152959f-ce14-32fd-86a8-671d81b7d983",
                                "text": "Then you'll dip-coat them with darkly colored soap."
